# BUG001 - Invalid Product Quantity is Accepted in Cart


## Description
The system allows a product to be added to the cart even when invalid quantity values (0 or extremely large numbers) are entered, without displaying any validation message or restriction.
This causes inconsistent cart data and affects system reliability.



## Steps to Reproduce
1. Navigate to Products page  
2. Select a product  
3. Click on "View Product"  
4. Enter quantity value: 0 or 100000000000000000  
5. Click on "Add to cart"  
6. Click on "View Cart"  


## Expected Result
The system should block invalid quantity inputs and display a validation message or enforce quantity limits.


## Actual Result
The system allows the product to be added to the cart with invalid quantity values without any validation or error message.


